https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QyjbVgP4nYo  (Capo 0)

TIP:  There are very minor variations depending on the recording.  This version is from the live album Wings Over America.  The intro riff repeats throughout the song.  It can be skipped after the intro but it's pretty easy to play once you get the cadence down.  It's a 5-note, 2-bar affair with a very quick change from (A7) to (Am) in the first bar and then from (A7) to (C) in the second bar.  It's all movement of the ring finger, first off and then to <c>.


